  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_GrimerMultipliesInSludge",
      "en_US": [
        "We’re careful about pollution here.\r",
        "We’ve heard Grimer multiplies in\n",
        "toxic sludge."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_DidYouSeeSSAnneInHarbor",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you see the S.S. Anne moored\n",
        "in the harbor?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "It’d stay on and work for me.\n",
        "Will you send me a {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanWhich",
      "en_US": "Which one?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanWrong",
      "en_US": "That’s not a {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_Machop",
      "en_US": "Machop: Guoh! Gogogoh!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_MachopStompingLandFlat",
      "en_US": "A Machop is stomping the land flat."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_SSAnneVisitsOnceAYear",
      "en_US": [
        "The S.S. Anne is a famous luxury\n",
        "cruise ship.\r",
        "It visits Vermilion once a year."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_WelcomeToTheSSAnne",
      "en_US": "Welcome to the S.S. Anne!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_Route2AideHasPackageForYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, hello, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\n",
        "How are you doing?\r",
        "It’s me, one of Prof. Oak’s Aides.\r",
        "Did you meet the other Aide?\r",
        "He had a package from Prof. Oak\n",
        "for you, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "He said he’d look for you around\n",
        "Route 2, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}.\r",
        "If you’re in the Route 2 area,\n",
        "please look for him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_CitySign",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion City\n",
        "The Port of Exquisite Sunsets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_PokemonFanClubSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon Fan Club\n",
        "All Pokémon fans welcome!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_GymSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Vermilion City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Lt. Surge\f",
        "The Lightning American!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_VermilionHarbor",
      "en_US": "Vermilion Harbor"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_SnorlaxBlockingRoute12",
      "en_US": [
        "Notice!\r",
        "Route 12 may be blocked off by a\n",
        "sleeping Pokémon.\r",
        "Detour through Rock Tunnel to\n",
        "Lavender Town.\r",
        "Vermilion Police"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_SSAnneHasDepartedForYear",
      "en_US": [
        "So, the S.S. Anne has departed?\r",
        "She’ll be back in Vermilion about\n",
        "this time next year."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m putting up a building on this\n",
        "plot of land. A big one!\r",
        "But my whole crew quit on me.\n",
        "All I’ve got left is this Machop.\r",
        "Say, could you lend me a hand?\n",
        "Another Machop would do it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanNext",
      "en_US": [
        "The building’s coming along!\n",
        "But I could use a {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanNo",
      "en_US": "Well, if you change your mind…"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Ha! Now that’s a worker!\n",
        "Welcome to the crew!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanNotShiny",
      "en_US": [
        "A Machamp! But I need a foreman\n",
        "that stands out on the site.\r",
        "One in a different color, you know?\n",
        "A shiny one!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanEgg",
      "en_US": "An Egg can’t lift beams!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanLastMon",
      "en_US": "I can’t take your only Pokémon!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_Johto_Text_FerryToOlivine",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, a Gym Leader Convention\n",
        "invitation!\r",
        "This ferry sails to Olivine City in\n",
        "Johto. Would you like to board?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_TheShipSetSail",
      "en_US": "The ship set sail."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_DoYouHaveATicket",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the S.S. Anne!\r",
        "Excuse me, do you have a ticket?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_FlashedSSTicket",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} flashed the S.S. Ticket!\r",
        "Great!\n",
        "Welcome to the S.S. Anne!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanFound",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, look what we dug up! An old\n",
        "fossil. Here, you have it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanFossil",
      "en_US": [
        "They say the lab on Cinnabar can\n",
        "bring those back to life!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanFoundTwo",
      "en_US": [
        "Would you look at that! Two\n",
        "fossils in the dig. Pick one!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_RootFossil",
      "en_US": "Root Fossil"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ClawFossil",
      "en_US": "Claw Fossil"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_SkullFossil",
      "en_US": "Skull Fossil"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ArmorFossil",
      "en_US": "Armor Fossil"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_VermilionCity_Text_ForemanBuilding",
      "en_US": [
        "A shiny Machamp! With a foreman\n",
        "like that, we’ll be done tonight!\r",
        "All right, boys!\n",
        "Let’s raise the roof!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_Johto_Text_FerryLater",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back anytime. The ferry’s\n",
        "always ready for a Leader!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0483_T06_Johto_Text_FerryDeparting",
      "en_US": "All right! All aboard!"
    },
    {
